<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P lifts NZI Insurance CPA rating to AA from AA-.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P lifts NZI Insurance CPA rating to AA from AA-.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit rating agency Standard and Poor's said on Monday it had raised its claim-paying ability rating on NZI Insurance New Zealand to AA from AA-.</p>
<p>The move follows similar action on U.K. parent General Accident Fire and Life Assurance Corp PLC.</p>
